      <h1>Dragify Terms of Use Agreement</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: January 3, 2026.</p>
      
      <p>This Terms of Use Agreement ("Agreement") applies to your access and use of the Dragify website (the "Site") and the Dragify mobile applications (each, the "App" and collectively, the "Apps") and related services (collectively, including the Site and Apps, the "Services") provided by Canonical LLC ("Dragify," "we," "us," or "our").</p>
      
