      <p>This Agreement and disputes arising from it are governed by the laws of [State/Country Placeholder], without regard to conflict-of-law principles, except where consumer protection laws require otherwise.</p>
      
      <h2>14. Electronic Communications</h2>
      <p>By using the Services, you consent to receiving communications electronically, including through the App, email, or postings in the Services. These communications satisfy legal notice requirements where permitted.</p>
      
      <h2>15. Termination; Modifications to Services</h2>
